cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper below.
title: lammps-precon-opt
abstract: >-
  Standalone Exp preconditioner for geometry optimisation in LAMMPS,
  working across arbitrary interatomic potentials. A LAMMPS-native C++
  plugin (fix precon/exp + min_style precon/lbfgs) plus a Python
  reference implementation validated stage-by-stage against ASE's
  reference Exp preconditioner.
authors:
